# Every text file is checked out with LF line endings on every platform, whatever core.autocrlf says.
# Generated files (scenes, grids, the terms review list, snapshots) are compared byte for byte by the tests, so a
# Windows checkout with CRLF would fail them and make a regeneration touch every line.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.woff2 binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.glb binary
*.pdf binary
